{"id":"0287df265ebdc8d6","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path.md","title":"无限分支树的任意高度不保证路径","display":"ex-unbounded-height-no-path — 无限分支树的任意高度不保证路径","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path","aliases":["20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path"],"display":"ex-unbounded-height-no-path — 无限分支树的任意高度不保证路径","chapter":"8","section":"8.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 8.3.1(i) 的有限分支边界","source_printed_pages":[168],"source_pdf_pages":[201],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-extendible]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-unbounded-height-no-path — 无限分支树的任意高度不保证路径"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.3.1(i) 的有限分支边界"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>201</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^k:=\\operatorname{rep}(0,k)\">\\(0^k:=\\operatorname{rep}(0,k)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T:=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\cup\\{(n)^\\frown0^k:n\\in\\omega,\\ k\\le n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T:=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\cup\\{(n)^\\frown0^k:n\\in\\omega,\\ k\\le n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{path}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{path}}\\)</span> 采用上游的两个不同定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}unbounded-height-no-path}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\omega(T)\\ \\land\\ \\forall m\\ (T\\cap\\omega^m\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\ \\land\\ [T]=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}unbounded-height-no-path}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\omega(T)\\ \\land\\ \\forall m\\ (T\\cap\\omega^m\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\ \\land\\ [T]=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{path}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{path}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员关系是有限检验，且任何前缀仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。给长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 可取首项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge m-1\">\\(n\\ge m-1\\)</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m-1\">\\(m-1\\)</span> 个零；但任一假想路径的首项固定为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，其长度不能超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>，矛盾。根有无限多个子节点，有限分支假设正是在此失效。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 168 / PDF 201；此具体反例为本地展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0^k:=\\operatorname{rep}(0,k)","display":false},{"tex":"T:=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\cup\\{(n)^\\frown0^k:n\\in\\omega,\\ k\\le n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{path}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}unbounded-height-no-path}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_\\omega(T)\\ \\land\\ \\forall m\\ (T\\cap\\omega^m\\ne\\varnothing)\n\\ \\land\\ [T]=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\setminus T^{\\mathrm{path}}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"m>0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge m-1","display":false},{"tex":"m-1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"任意长延伸与位于一条无限路径上是两种分别定义的性质，不在 Hypothesis 预先使用本定义。路径节点必有任意长延伸；反向在二值或有限分支树上由 König 引理成立，无限分支时会失败，见 [[20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path]]。空树的两个集合均为空。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path]] — 章 8；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-unbounded-height-no-path]]"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","8705fb72e379b21a"]}